# Read-only balance/order-history credentials suffice for research.py economics --accounts.
# Trade permission is required only for explicitly enabled live execution and cancellation.
# Never enable withdrawals. Prefer separate keys for research and a dedicated live account.
# Coinbase Advanced CDP key: organizations/.../apiKeys/...
# PEM secret can use literal \n sequences inside a quoted value.
COINBASE_API_KEY=
COINBASE_SECRET=
KRAKEN_API_KEY=
KRAKEN_SECRET=
